Package: ezrsurvey
Type: Package
Title: Single-Line Helpers for Consumer Survey Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andreas", "Schellewald", email = "aschellewald@acm.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simplifies the day-to-day work of research and insights
    professionals who analyse consumer and customer survey data but have limited
    coding experience. Wraps common 'tidyverse' patterns into single-line
    functions for the tasks these teams repeat constantly: loading and combining
    survey exports, turning questions into percentages and summaries, recoding
    rating and Net Promoter scales, deriving demographics such as age cohorts
    and regions, modelling the drivers of satisfaction, checking sampling
    precision, selecting illustrative open-text comments, and producing
    presentation-ready charts and reports. A simulated consumer-survey dataset
    is included for learning and examples.
